<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9700] Remove configurable values from mesos pom.xml</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9700</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;pom.xml contains urls and paths that can be configured when building, but it introduces git changes with every build.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need to update the links in the file and remove them from build process, since the whole process depends on the the links and will not likely be changed in near future.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
